[size=4][b]Fagot-M2 — Multirole ATGM Suite (English)[/b][/size]

This fan mod [b]replaces the vanilla Javelin ATGM with the Fagot-M2 multirole ATGM suite[/b]: it adds three special ammunition types — [b]EMP[/b], [b]Neural Breach («Schizo»)[/b] and [b]Cyber Hack («Takeover»)[/b]. Plus the stock rocket, for four selectable fire modes total. The Javelin is replaced everywhere the ATGM launcher is available (campaign, Skirmish, DLCs).

[b]Modes:[/b]
[list]
[*]🚀 [b]Stock ATGM[/b] — regular anti-tank rocket, untouched vanilla behavior.
[*]🔵 [b]EMP[/b] — suspends the target for ~45 s. No team change, no damage to the logic layer.
[*]🟡 [b]Neural Breach («Schizo»)[/b] — the captured target becomes an allied [i]autonomous[/i] unit (ally-colored team).
[*]🟢 [b]Cyber Hack («Takeover»)[/b] — the captured target comes under [i]direct player control[/i] (player team).
[/list]

[b]How it works (short version):[/b] SpreadsheetML (.xml) overrides add the ammo rows and three effect profiles; the launcher mode is dispatched by the life_time signature (0.8 / 0.9 / 1.0) with a shared 30 m effect radius. A patched game logic.dll performs the team switch at projectile impact; in TRACE builds, only Takeover-captured targets are logged. No global AI hooks. The installer verifies your logic.dll SHA256 (baseline 29EB…6044), creates a verified backup first and re-verifies after copying; one-command rollback (RESTORE_REV1.9.1_STABLE.bat).

[b]Requirements:[/b] game build [b]1.08.1173[/b] (tested); single-player / offline only; campaign, Skirmish and DLCs (We Are Legion / Uprising — DLC rows are generated from your installed PAKs at install time).

[b]Installation (Windows):[/b] close the game → copy the mod folder to …\Terminator Dark Fate - Defiance\Terminator Dark Fate - Defiance\mods\<mod folder>\ → run INSTALL_FINAL.bat → in-game: MODS menu, enable this package and disable any older FagotM2 versions. Rollback: RESTORE_REV1.9.1_STABLE.bat.

[b]Status: working beta[/b] — bugs exist, but the mod is functional. Quick self-check in Skirmish: pick the Bridges («Мосты») map, set the opponent to Legion, deploy your ATGM teams and test all four fire modes.

[b]Known issues (public beta):[/b] some Takeover-captured units keep a residual AI controller (robots/spiders may act autonomously under player+AI mixed control); Skirmish balance is not finalized. The current build REV1.9.4 TRACE V2 logs captured-target diagnostics to bin\FagotM2_debug.log (stays on your PC) — attaching it to a bug report speeds up the fix a lot.

